            <ArticleTitle>A clinical diagnosis of inadvertent epidural administration of potassium chloride.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>410-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a case of accidental epidural administration of potassium chloride, which was diagnosed by clinical signs. The genesis of symptoms and signs following such administration is discussed and compared with other published reports.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
